# Emissions Notification System

> [!TIP]
> A new notification bell in the dashboard header alerts users when they exceed or approach their emission goals.

## New Features

### 1. Real-Time Alert Logic
- **Critical Alert (Red)**: Triggered when Total Emissions >= Goal Target.
- **Warning Alert (Amber)**: Triggered when Total Emissions >= 80% of Goal Target.
- **Info Alert (Blue)**: Displayed when no goal is set for the current year.

### 2. UI Components ([dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.html))
- **Notification Badge**: A red dot indicator appears on the bell icon when alerts are active.
- **Dropdown List**: Clicking the bell reveals detailed messages with timestamps.

### 3. Implementation Details
- **[notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/notification-logic.js)**: 
    - Fetches the user's latest emissions and goals derived from the database.
    - Calculates the current year's total.
    - Dynamically generates the notification list on page load.
    - Handles the dropdown toggle interaction.

